{"post_number": 1, "author": "ada", "author_name": "Ada", "created_at": "2026-03-02T09:15:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-02T09:15:00Z", "url": "https://forum.example/t/101/1", "body_text": "Format A keeps the registry small, which matters for constrained clients. Format B needs a new parser.", "content_hash": "07247c35f0b0ae4dfcf39c8d21edf64a493d727d35a05d34ecf695f5ef0d8670", "reply_to_post_number": null}
{"post_number": 2, "author": "brin", "author_name": "Brin", "created_at": "2026-03-02T11:40:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-02T12:05:00Z", "url": "https://forum.example/t/101/2", "body_text": "Format A cannot express nested groups, so it blocks the grouping feature we agreed on.", "content_hash": "cbe49a389a70e35056725946a8063a353d42b966f2a19d841065ca837f6d6446", "reply_to_post_number": 1}
{"post_number": 3, "author": "cyd", "author_name": "Cyd", "created_at": "2026-03-03T08:05:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-03T08:05:00Z", "url": "https://forum.example/t/101/3", "body_text": "I prefer Format B after reading the parser sketch. Nested groups are worth the extra code.", "content_hash": "f2a7b20c46e789a5562f9a3802d0e32ef706798cbfa19cd37ff98deee1ad150b", "reply_to_post_number": 2}
{"post_number": 4, "author": "cyd", "author_name": "Cyd", "created_at": "2026-03-05T14:20:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-05T14:20:00Z", "url": "https://forum.example/t/101/4", "body_text": "Changing my mind: Format A plus the grouping shim is enough, so I now prefer Format A.", "content_hash": "76a10b781ac228c212c2d320b38c53b896770b3d31fd951b5f87c8eaddf6b9ab", "reply_to_post_number": 3}
